 &lt;span class="heading-text"&gt;Before you begin&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a class="heading-anchor" href="#before-you-begin" aria-label="Permalink" aria-hidden="true"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use a Splunk Show instance, a Linux computer, or an Apple silicon Mac. You also
need &lt;code&gt;bash&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;curl&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;jq&lt;/code&gt;, and a text editor. If you use a Splunk Show instance,
your local computer also needs &lt;code&gt;ssh&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;scp&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pairing is optional. For cloud verification, sign in or
